            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1311078?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">Hashgraph is a block-chain like algorithm with latencies similar to Paxos.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"244872966\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/papers-we-love/papers-we-love/issues/471\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/papers-we-love/papers-we-love/issues/471/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/papers-we-love/papers-we-love/issues/471\">#471</a></p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Paper Title: Hashgraph Consensus: Fair, Fast, Byzantine Fault Tolerance</h2>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Paper Year: 2016</h3>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Reasons for including paper</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Hashgraph is a block-chain like algorithm with Paxos like performance.  Overall, this is an important breakthrough.</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">see <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"244872966\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/papers-we-love/papers-we-love/issues/471\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/papers-we-love/papers-we-love/issues/471/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/papers-we-love/papers-we-love/issues/471\">#471</a></p>",
