        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4047274?u=913cc9e683153fbbb1bd690dca2829d0ce95249d&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">… to networks</p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Paper Title:</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">B4: Experience with a Globally-Deployed Software Defined WAN</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Paper Year:</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">2013</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Reasons for including paper</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>This paper was likely the first large demonstration of SDN networks in industry.</li>\n<li>In my opinion, it set the benchmark for a number SDN companies on what their product had to be.</li>\n<li>This is a great demonstration of 'Intent Based Networking' which is something that only now the industry is starting to see</li>\n</ul>",
            "url": "https://github.com/papers-we-love/papers-we-love/pull/513",
            "title": "Adding `B4: experience with a globally-deployed software defined WAN`",
