        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7947900?u=56e4b982fd65fb4e24f4455de480c966d8edd92f&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h2 dir=\"auto\">Paper Title: Meltdown / Spectre Attacks: Exploiting Speculative Execution</h2>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Paper Year: 2018</h3>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Reasons for including paper</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Meltdown and Spectre are two of the largest scale vulnerabilities in modern computing, affecting nearly all computers.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">More info available at <a href=\"http://meltdownattack.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">http://meltdownattack.com</a> or <a href=\"http://spectreattack.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">http://spectreattack.com</a>.</p>",
