        {
            "content_html": "<h2 dir=\"auto\">Paper Title: Datacenter Traffic Control: Understanding Techniques and Trade-offs</h2>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Paper Year: 2017</h3>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Reasons for including paper</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>This paper covers a wide range of topics regarding how traffic is routed and scheduled across datacenter networks.</li>\n<li>It also provides a short background on specifics of datacenter topology, traffic and management.</li>\n<li>What makes this paper different is that it discusses trade-offs across many existing research proposals which allows readers to get familiar with important factors and considerations.</li>\n<li>It is also rather conceptual and does not focus on detailed technical parameters which makes it an easy tutorial to datacenter traffic control.</li>\n</ul>",
            "url": "https://github.com/papers-we-love/papers-we-love/pull/508",
            "title": "Added paper on datacenter traffic control review",
            "date_modified": "2018-02-02T13:42:33.000Z",
            "date_published": "2018-02-02T02:39:18.000Z",
